    "doThis": "Sit on the floor. Exercise 1: hands clasp behind the head, open the elbows. Exercise 2: pull a scarf or towel wide across the mid-back. Exercise 3: hands behind the head again, squeeze. Fifteen each as the clip marks. Ease every return over three.\nUse a strict 3-Second Negative on every lowering / return phase.",
