    "metrics": "Sets: 3  |  Reps: 6–8 or 8–10  |  Hold: 20–30 sec  |  Rest: 45 sec",
    "leadRule": "Prone. One minute each — head clasp, low-back stack, towel pull. Chest stays on the floor.",
    "doThis": "Lie prone. Minute one: hands behind the head, elbows off the floor. Minute two: hands stacked in the low back. Minute three: hold a towel wide and pull. One minute each as the clip marks. Ease off over three.\nUse a strict 3-Second Negative on every lowering / return phase.",
    "avoidThis": "Lifting the chest into a cobra on every station. Rushing all three minutes into one thirty-second mash.",
